Everything under:

    app/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/

is the host-side extension API that Keiyoushi/Mihon extensions are compiled
against (`compileOnly`) and therefore do not ship themselves. It originates
from Mihon (https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, and was obtained here via Kagari
(https://github.com/mogheess/kagari), also Apache License 2.0, which had
already adapted it for a non-Mihon host.

Adapted for VANTARA. Class and package names are deliberately unchanged:
extensions link against these exact fully-qualified names, so renaming them
would break every extension.

